Glasswater is an affluent district of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], named for the stretch of river that runs through it. The banks are lined with glassware that catches the light and throws it back into the water in rainbow colours, a small copy of the aurora the [[Iridescent Host|Host]] hangs over the city.
